SUMMARY:Saturday Weekly DJ's
DESCRIPTION:Although we are primarily a Live Music Calendar\, we often come across Electronic & DJ events in the area and list them for you as we find out about them. Please verify the DJ\, times and cover charges with the venue. \nWaterstreet – 3-7pm \nLA Pizza Party Rooftop – 6-9pm \nWicked Weed Funkatorium – 6-10pm \nThe Radical – 6-11pm \nPotential New Boyfriend – 7:30-11pm \nCapella On 9 – 8-11pm \nBen’s Tune Up – 8-11pm \nHemingways Cuba – 9pm-12am \nThe Tiki Easy Bar – 9pm-12am \nBanks Ave – 9-11:30pm \nHavana Miami – 9pm-2am \nStatic Age Loft – 9pm-2am \nWaterstreet – 9pm-2am \nNightshade – 9pm-1am \nVOWL – 9pm-1am \nBarleys Upstairs – 10pm-1am \nLa Pizza Party South Slope – 10pm-2am \nFarməse – 10pm-1am \nThe Barksdale – 10pm-2am \nDouble Crown – 10pm-2am \nLazy Diamond – 10pm-2am \nStrange Magic Bar – 10pm-2am \nShakeys – 10pm-2am \nVerify with the venue on time\, cover charges and tonight’s DJ.
URL:https://livemusicasheville.com/calendar/saturday-weekly-dj-schedule/2026-07-04/
LOCATION:NC\, United States
CATEGORIES:Asheville Area,DJ/Electronic
END:VEVENT
